  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">QUALITY EDUCATION &amp; 21st CENTURY SKILLS FOR GIRLS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the 21st century, it is not enough to graduate from a high school or a university. Everyone but especially young generations need new skills to be successful in the information age. Unfortunately, these skills are not covered in the formal education curriculum in Turkey. Therefore, CYDD started two new projects for its socio-economically disadvantaged secondary and high school female students. Seminars&apos; contents are prepared and conducted by professional instructors.</narrative>
  </description>
